{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20260802/photo/bkn-20260802165235791-0802_00992_001_01p.jpg?20260802185053\"/><p>新西蘭發生地震，星號為震央。</p><p>新西蘭北島東部沿岸地區周日（2日）晚上8時35分左右發生黎克特制5.9級地震，震源深度約10公里。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-02T14:54:58.980576+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":72,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none"}}